{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-ed29771026e7","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-ed29771026e7","name":"奶茶","category":"drink","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/drink/%E5%A5%B6%E8%8C%B6.md","blob_sha":"87580f984c81e592264d00be74b3ef16fc95c26d","details":{"introduction":"这是一道用红茶和奶粉轻松调制的家常饮品，茶香与奶香交融，口感顺滑温暖。红茶中的茶多酚搭配牛奶的蛋白质和钙质，既能提神又补充日常营养。做法非常简单，新手也能一次成功，仅需大约半 小时就能喝上自制奶茶。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 袋泡红茶（推荐立顿黄牌精选红茶）\n- 全脂奶粉或淡奶\n- 杯子，例如带刻度的杯子，陶瓷杯或保温杯"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每份：\n\n- 袋泡红茶 2 包（约 4g）\n- 奶粉 11-12g\n- 砂糖 5-7g"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 取袋泡红茶 2 包放入杯中，加入 180-200mL **沸水**。\n2. **等待 20 - 30 分钟**。\n3. 称取 11-12g 奶粉和 5-7g 砂糖，分别加入前一步骤得到的液体中。\n4. 搅拌均匀即可饮用。"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 加入沸水后，尽量保持杯子内部温暖，例如使用开口较小的杯子或盖上盖子。如果气温较低时，使用量杯量取可能导致沸水在冲入红茶前冷却，则可以不使用量杯量取而直接估计其体积。\n- 等待时间结束后可提起或搅动茶包以使冲泡更加均匀。"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：泡好无糖红茶300g、3.25%全脂牛奶250g、白砂糖50g；整份约600g。无珍珠及奶精的全脂牛奶红茶，糖量固定，不代表奶茶店商品。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":58.166667,"protein_g":1.3125,"carbohydrate_g":10.475,"fat_g":1.3625},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173227/nutrients","version":"08d0a57992fb96c8","fdc_ids":[173227,172217,169655]},"profile_id":"family-ed29771026e7-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-ed29771026e7","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-ed29771026e7","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"cold_mix","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-ed29771026e7-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"tea","grams":300},{"key":"milk","grams":250},{"key":"sugar","grams":50}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"08d0a57992fb96c8","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-ed29771026e7-v1.973ae317ec10f0fe.json","bytes":16921,"sha256":"973ae317ec10f0fe64702a19a0f3c4e064942b362afed176636c9d0790df9794"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-ed29771026e7-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-ed29771026e7","recipe_blob_sha":"87580f984c81e592264d00be74b3ef16fc95c26d","version":"1","data_version":"08d0a57992fb96c8","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：泡好无糖红茶300g、3.25%全脂牛奶250g、白砂糖50g；整份约600g。无珍珠及奶精的全脂牛奶红茶，糖量固定，不代表奶茶店商品。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-ed29771026e7","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"cold_mix","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-ed29771026e7-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"tea","grams":300},{"key":"milk","grams":250},{"key":"sugar","grams":50}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":58.166667,"protein_g":1.3125,"carbohydrate_g":10.475,"fat_g":1.3625},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173227/nutrients","version":"08d0a57992fb96c8","fdc_ids":[173227,172217,169655]},"rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","is_estimate":true,"requires_independent_match":true,"details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-ed29771026e7-v1.973ae317ec10f0fe.json","bytes":16921,"sha256":"973ae317ec10f0fe64702a19a0f3c4e064942b362afed176636c9d0790df9794"}}]}
